cks":{}}},"block_order":["text_KFrYRH"]},"accordion_row_kJKarE":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"What are Tat Sat crystals used for?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_i9Hakn":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Each crystal carries a specific intention - Love, Clarity, Protection, Wealth, Focus, Healing, and more.<br\/>They’re more than accessories, they’re energetic allies, coded to support your dharma and dissolve karmic patterns. Every crystal comes with a Tat Sat Karmic Lightbook - guidance tailored to your frequency.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_i9Hakn"]},"accordion_row_wa4zqf":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"What are crystal birds and trees for?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_i3RgKp":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Our crystal birds and trees are sacred décor, blessed for space healing and energy flow.<\/p><p><strong>Crystal Birds:<\/strong> Placed in living rooms, study or workspaces to attract Peace, Joy and Higher communication. Each color and shape aligns with specific energies.<br\/><br\/><strong>Crystal Trees:<\/strong> Represent Growth, Love and Peace blessings. Ideal for meditation corners, bedroom, desks, or family zones.<br\/><br\/><em>They are not decorative pieces, they are <\/em><em><strong>frequency anchors <\/strong><\/em><em>for<br\/>your environment.<\/em><\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--famil