h Ritual, reserved for deep soul work.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_FDA4za"]},"accordion_row_DhPDpQ":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"Are your products ritual-activated?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_QEycYC":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Yes. All crystals, including Bracelets, Neck Pieces, Birds, and Bonsai Trees are ritually activated through our healing ceremonies. You don’t just receive a product, you receive an awakened divine companion.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_QEycYC"]},"accordion_row_idkn74":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"How should I take care of my crystal?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_4wNdNb":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>To maintain frequency:<\/p><ul><li>Store separately from heavy electronics.<\/li><li>Rest the Crystal Bracelets on a Manifesting Selenite Charging Plate overnight.<\/li><li>Avoid water rituals unless mentioned<\/li><li>Follow your Tat Sat Karmic Lightbook for karmic alignment.<\/li><li>Speak to it - intention energises your bond.<\/li><li>Hold the crystal in your dominant hand (or place the neck piece over your heart).<\/li><li>Close your eyes and repeat: “I align with light, truth, and energy. This crystal walks with me in power and peace.”<\/li><\/ul>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_4wNdNb"]},"accordion_row_NcDfph":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"How do I receive my crystal?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_y6p6Wd":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>The crystal is energetically sealed and nestled within a Tat Sat alter case, accompanied by your Karmic Lightbook - a sacred soul scroll crafted to mirror the crystal’s newly awakened energy map.<br\/>Your piece is now a Divine Companion, encoded, activated, and ready to walk beside your soul.<br\/><br\/><br\/><\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_y6p6Wd"]},"accordion_row_PDVhRq":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"Are these replacements for medical treatment?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_faNEqj":{"type":"text","